  "name": "STEMGym",
  "description": "STEMGym provides 15 simulated STEM worlds across five material systems. The benchmark core comprises 13 coordinate-bounds-consistent worlds and 13,600 tiles; two additional records have inconsistent field bounds. Coordinate bounds do not establish physical calibration. Three analyst checkpoints support the 220-episode defect-census reference evaluation. The Croissant record set exposes the file inventory, not individual HDF5 image arrays.",
